28	/* Data for the VPS deploy wizard.
29	 *
30	 * The one rule this file exists to keep: every number the wizard can display is
31	 * computed HERE, by the same functions that charge the card, and handed down
32	 * already worked out. The view prints; it never multiplies.
33	 *
34	 * `effectiveMonthlyCents` is built as a plan x term MATRIX rather than sent as a
35	 * rate plus a discount percent. Sending the percent would mean the browser does
36	 * `rate * (1 - pct)` — a second pricing formula, and the one that is on screen
37	 * when the customer decides. Terms are few and plans are few, so the matrix is
38	 * cheap and it cannot drift from `vpsTermPriceCents`.
39	 */
